<title>ITALY: Italy oil product consumption down 1.1 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Italy oil product consumption down 1.1 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian consumption of oil products fell 1.1 percent to 8.2 million tonnes in October, compared with October 1995, according to data from trade group Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>  Category			1996 (thousand tonnes) Chg vs 1995</p>
<p>  Total				 8,200		  -1.1 pct</p>
<p>  Gasoline			    1,580		  +6.3 pct</p>
<p>  Total gas oil		     2,147		  -4.1 pct</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p>   Car diesel			 1,339		 -13.1 pct</p>
<p>   Heating oil			  498		  -6.7 pct</p>
<p>Note: Unione Petrolifera said in a statement Italian oil product consumption fell 0.9 percent to 77.9 million tonnes in the first 10 months of the year compared to the same period in 1995. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
